^["stream"]{
 >>[2026-02-20 03:09] observe — The codebase contains implicit "developer knowledge"—rules about how UI states interact that exist only in component logic rather than explicit type systems or data models.
 >>[2026-02-20 03:09] decide — We need to audit specific UI *clusters* (e.g., the keyboard, settings panels, shaders) to extract this knowledge into formalized Spw-centric data structures.
 >>[2026-02-20 05:40] revise — Expanded plan to 26 commits, restructuring the UI audits into a masterclass on 'Valence Algebras', 'Topological Intents', and 'Visual Calculus'.
 >>[2026-07-27 13:15] observe — plan-ecology sweep: every predicted path targets src/core/models/, which no longer exists in this repo. src/ now holds only runtime, seed, and testing shims. This plan is stranded on a deleted layout, not in progress — disposition (relocate to a site repo, re-scope against packages/, or archive as superseded) is a user call.
}

